      "text": "Gi' you di small tings, mi go design (woh)"
    },
    {
      "time": 44.0,
      "text": "You run di lines, mi rewrite time"
    },
    {
      "time": 46.3,
      "text": "Mi give up a likkle, get back a shrine"
    },
    {
      "time": 48.6,
      "text": "Mi trade you my hands, tek back my soul (soul)"
