    },
    {
      "time": 53.2,
      "text": "You count di coin, mi change di world role"
    },
    {
      "time": 55.5,
      "text": "Mi give up control, gain full control (hey!)"
    },
    {
      "time": 57.8,
      "type": "section",
      "text": "[Verse 2]"
    },
    {
      "time": 58.8,
      "text": "You fill out form, mi a build di platform"
